; One `open` per account and category. Replace every "Nome" with the person's first name
; (one block per person) and keep only the accounts and categories they have.
; kind: cash | investment | receivable | debt | tax | pension | property
; name: how the account is shown on the dashboard (optional)

; ── accounts: Assets:<Nome>:<Institution>, Liabilities:<Nome>:<What> ──
2025-12-31 open Assets:Nome:Conto-corrente        EUR
  kind: "cash"
  name: "Conto corrente"
2025-12-31 open Assets:Nome:Conto-deposito        EUR
  kind: "cash"
2025-12-31 open Liabilities:Nome:Carta-di-credito EUR
  kind: "debt"
  name: "Carta di credito"
2025-12-31 open Assets:Nome:Transit

; only if they invest: one commodity per security, the broker as an investment account
; 2025-12-31 commodity VWCE
;   kind: "security"
; 2025-12-31 open Assets:Nome:Broker
;   kind: "investment"
; 2025-12-31 open Income:Nome:Capital-Gains

; ── income: Income:<Nome>:<Type> ──
2025-12-31 open Income:Nome:Stipendio
2025-12-31 open Income:Nome:Rimborsi
2025-12-31 open Income:Nome:Interessi
2025-12-31 open Income:Nome:Altro

; ── categories: Expenses:<Category>[:<Detail>] (the first part is what the dashboard shows) ──
2025-12-31 open Expenses:Casa:Affitto
2025-12-31 open Expenses:Casa:Condominio
2025-12-31 open Expenses:Spesa
2025-12-31 open Expenses:Bollette
2025-12-31 open Expenses:Trasporti
2025-12-31 open Expenses:Salute
2025-12-31 open Expenses:Ristoranti
2025-12-31 open Expenses:Viaggi
2025-12-31 open Expenses:Shopping
2025-12-31 open Expenses:Abbonamenti
2025-12-31 open Expenses:Svago
2025-12-31 open Expenses:Regali
2025-12-31 open Expenses:Contanti
2025-12-31 open Expenses:Commissioni
2025-12-31 open Expenses:Fees
2025-12-31 open Expenses:Tasse
2025-12-31 open Expenses:Da-classificare

2025-12-31 open Equity:Opening-Balances
2025-12-31 open Equity:Revaluation
